ns<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java 8 Interview Questions for 10 Years Experience<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some advanced Java 8 interview questions for 10+ years experienced candidate:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Can you explain the use of parallel Streams in Java 8 and their performance implications?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the limitations and trade-offs of using parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you handle exceptions while using Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you provide an example of how to use the collect operation to group elements in a Stream in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the flatMap operation in Java 8 Streams for flattening collections?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you handle infinite Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the performance differences between sequential and parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the partitioning collector in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the difference between reduce and collect operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you show an example of using the mapToInt, mapToLong, and mapToDouble operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the toArray operation in Java 8 Streams and its performance implications?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the anyMatch, allMatch, and noneMatch operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>These are some of the more advanced questions related to Java 8 and are suitable for a candidate with 10+ years of experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/java-interview-questions-answers\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Top 100+ Java Interview Questions and Answers<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java 8 Interview Questions for 12 Years Experience<\/h2>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some advanced Java 8 interview questions for a 12+ years experienced candidate:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>How do you ensure thread safety while using parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the limitations and trade-offs of using parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the common performance optimization techniques while using Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you handle exceptions while using Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you provide an example of how to use the collect operation to group elements in a Stream in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the flatMap operation in Java 8 Streams for flattening collections?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you handle infinite Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the performance differences between sequential and parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the partitioning collector in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the difference between reduce and collect operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you show an example of using the mapToInt, mapToLong, and mapToDouble operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you discuss the use of the toArray operation in Java 8 Streams and its performance implications?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the use of the anyMatch, allMatch, and noneMatch operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>These are some of the more advanced questions related to Java 8 and are suitable for a candidate with 12+ years of experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java 8 Stream Interview Questions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some common Java 8 Stream interview questions:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>What is a Stream in Java 8, and how is it different from a Collection?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you create a Stream in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the intermediate operations in Java 8 Stream API?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the terminal operations in Java 8 Stream API?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the difference between map and flatMap in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What is the use of Optional in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you provide an example of how to use parallel Streams in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the different ways to create a Stream in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the difference between reduce and collect in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you show how to use the filter operation in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do you sort a Stream in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you show how to use the groupBy operation in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the difference between Stream and Sequence in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you show an example of using the min and max operations in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>These are some of the popular questions related to Java 8 Streams.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Java 8 Features Interview Questions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some common Java 8 features interview questions:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>What is the biggest feature added in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the concept of Lambda expressions in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What is a functional interface in Java 8, and how is it used?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How do the default and static methods in interfaces work in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you provide an example of how to use the Stream API in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the difference between forEach and forEachOrdered in Java 8 Streams?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>How does the Optional class in Java 8 help to prevent NullPointerException?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the new Date and Time APIs introduced in Java 8?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Can you explain the difference betwee